From: Jeffy Chen <jeffy.chen@rock-chips.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Jul 2021 14:38:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 07/98] gl-renderer: Support NV16 dmabuf format

Signed-off-by: Jeffy Chen <jeffy.chen@rock-chips.com>
---
 libweston/renderer-gl/gl-renderer.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/libweston/renderer-gl/gl-renderer.c b/libweston/renderer-gl/gl-renderer.c
index 7070bee8..1a7274b7 100644
--- a/libweston/renderer-gl/gl-renderer.c
+++ b/libweston/renderer-gl/gl-renderer.c
@@ -4148,6 +4148,7 @@ gl_renderer_query_dmabuf_formats(struct weston_compositor *wc,
 		DRM_FORMAT_XRGB8888,
 		DRM_FORMAT_YUYV,
 		DRM_FORMAT_NV12,
+		DRM_FORMAT_NV16,
 		DRM_FORMAT_YUV420,
 		DRM_FORMAT_YUV422,
 		DRM_FORMAT_YUV444,
